# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Linfeng Zhang et al. (2022). A deep potential model with long-range electrostatic interactions.
#   The Journal of Chemical Physics. doi:10.1063/5.0083669  arXiv:2112.13327v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2112.13327v2 (sha256 fe49d1c17f55a946...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 418 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/zhang2022.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the PBE water data set built with DP-GEN (583
# configurations: 135 initial plus 323 bulk, 94 surface and 31
# low-density), the DP, Deep Wannier (DW) and DPLR models for water, the
# NaCl DP and DPLR models, and the errors stated in the text (water
# energies in meV/H2O at the chosen beta = 0.4 1/A and for DP with
# 6 and 8 A cutoffs; NaCl training errors). The DW centroid errors (A)
# are not energy/force errors. Dimer energies, free-energy profiles and
# phonons are properties.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix mls: <http://www.w3.org/ns/mls#> .
@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .
@prefix mlips: <https://w3id.org/mlips#> .
@prefix entity: <https://w3id.org/mlips/entity/> .

###############################################################################
# Q1 -- Bibliographic identification
###############################################################################

entity:study-zhang2022 a mlips:BenchmarkStudy ;
    rdfs:label "Zhang et al. (2022): the Deep Potential Long-Range (DPLR) model with Wannier-centroid Gaussian charges, for water and NaCl" ;
    mlips:reportedIn entity:article-zhang2022 .

